    "caveats": [
      "Verify the exact arterial shear target for your model — large arteries can reach 1–3 Pa; 1 Pa is the upper HUVEC physiological range and a common arterial OOC target.",
      "Confirm medium viscosity (assumed 1e-3 Pa·s); serum-containing medium is ~0.9–1.1e-3 Pa·s and shifts shear proportionally.",
      "HUVEC should be seeded and allowed to reach confluence under low/no flow before ramping to 40 µL/min to avoid detachment.",
      "Confirm endothelial alignment and junctional markers (VE-cadherin, ZO-1) after 24–48 h of arterial shear as the functional readout.",
